Package: owlet
Architecture: amd64
Build-Profiles: <!nocpu>
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-pipewire,
Conflicts: owlet-vulkan, owlet-hip
# libei ≥ 1.6 enables Owlet's TEXT path at build time; Ubuntu 26.04 /
# Debian sid still ship 1.5, so meson skips linking and ${shlibs:Depends}
# will not pull libei1. Keep it as a Recommends for hosts that do have it.
Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-desktop-portal, libei1
Suggests: ydotool, xdotool
Description: Speech-to-text GNOME app (CPU backend)
 Owlet is a GTK4 + libadwaita speech-to-text app. Local inference uses
 the bundled transcribe.cpp engine (statically linked). This package
 builds the CPU ggml backend.
 .
 GPU backends are separate packages (owlet-vulkan, owlet-hip); only one
 variant can be installed at a time. Speech models are downloaded at
 runtime and are not bundled.

Package: owlet-vulkan
Architecture: amd64
Build-Profiles: <!nouvulkan>
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-pipewire,
 libvulkan1,
Provides: owlet
Conflicts: owlet
Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-desktop-portal, libei1
Suggests: ydotool, xdotool
Description: Speech-to-text GNOME app (Vulkan backend)
 Owlet is a GTK4 + libadwaita speech-to-text app. Local inference uses
 the bundled transcribe.cpp engine (statically linked). This package
 builds the Vulkan ggml backend.
 .
 Mutually exclusive with owlet (CPU) and owlet-hip. Speech models are
 downloaded at runtime and are not bundled.

Package: owlet-hip
Architecture: amd64
Build-Profiles: <!nohip>
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-pipewire,
 rocm-hip-runtime | hip-runtime-amd,
 hipblas,
 rocblas,
Provides: owlet
Conflicts: owlet
Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-desktop-portal, libei1
Suggests: ydotool, xdotool
Description: Speech-to-text GNOME app (AMD HIP/ROCm backend)
 Owlet is a GTK4 + libadwaita speech-to-text app. Local inference uses
 the bundled transcribe.cpp engine (statically linked). This package
 builds the HIP/ROCm ggml backend.
 .
 Requires AMD's ROCm apt repository (repo.radeon.com) for runtime
 libraries. Mutually exclusive with owlet (CPU) and owlet-vulkan.
 Speech models are downloaded at runtime and are not bundled.